    RefIds:
    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 1ba0f3f01fc94390837d21d85118d87a
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'BIO support agent (spore mender): the pack''s long-range support. It stays far behind the pack, some 24 m from the target and clear of the fight, and works through the bushes to get there. From there it lobs Mending Spores (Support: a 5 m cloud, up to 20 m away, that heals, regrows bone plating and clears burns, bleeds and poison) onto whoever is being mauled or worn down, roars the pack on (Signature: Rallying Roar, 22 m), and spits slow bone spikes at the target between casts. Anything that gets within 7 m is held and drained with a Feeding Bite (the player must tap Interact to shake it off), after which it backs away to its range again. Only when badly hurt and cornered does it vanish (Escape: Ambush) or slip into a bush. Calm, it follows its leader at a distance and mends anyone still hurt. Kit: Support (Mending Spores), Signature (Rallying Roar), Escape (Ambush).'
        _children:
        - b79eccccd36842159d0bf949c8ee649d
    - rid: 1001
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
